<title>UK: North Sea Troll Nov loadings up at 7.26 mln bls.</title>
<headline>North Sea Troll Nov loadings up at 7.26 mln bls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Troll oilfield is scheduled to load 14 cargoes totalling 7.26 million barrels in November, up from 7.18 million barrels in the original October programme, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The November programme is made up of one cargo of 360,000 barrels, four cargoes of 400,000 barrels, five of 500,000 barrels, three of 600,000 barrels and one of one million barrels, they said.</p>
<p>On the basis of the programme, Troll will pump an average of 242,000 barrels per day (bpd) in November, compared with 231,000 bpd in October, 232,000 bpd in September and 254,000 bpd in August.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
